 "code": "def product_except_self(nums: list[int]) -> list[int]:\n    n = len(nums)\n    out = [1] * n\n\n    running = 1                      # product of nums[0..i-1]\n    for i in range(n):\n        out[i] = running\n        running *= nums[i]\n\n    running = 1                      # product of nums[i+1..n-1]\n    for i in range(n - 1, -1, -1):\n        out[i] *= running\n        running *= nums[i]\n    return out\n",
